
  Manage resources                                                              
         
  USAGE  
         
    cli-app resource [command] [--flags]  
            
  COMMANDS  
            
    apply <name>   Apply a resource
    list           List resources
    status <name>  Show a resource status
         
  FLAGS  
         
    --color        Result color mode (auto, always, never) (auto)
    --config       Configuration file path
    -h --help      Help for resource
    --log-level    Logging level (debug, info, warn, error) (warn)
    --output       Result format (text, json) (text)
    --quiet        Suppress non-essential output
    --timeout      Override the timeout for the selected resource operation (0s)

